  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A trader with a memory. msm:trader opens the villager trading screen with the wandering trader's common wares, then its rare ones as players trade. reputation keeps a value for each player: each trade adds 2 (up to 25), each poppy given to it (used on it) adds 10 (gift, up to 25) and each hit takes 25 away; the value changes every price for that player and fades a little each day. It is never shared with other mobs. demand true raises the price of a trade bought out after the next restock, as with villagers. work_site makes it walk to the nearest barrel within 16 blocks to restock, twice a day. The barter goal takes a gold ingot handed to it or dropped near it and drops a roll of vanilla's piglin bartering loot after six seconds. It does not spawn on its own: use its spawn egg.",
